    <div>
      <span class='eyebrow'>Everything in one download</span>
      <h2 class='h2' id='aih-pack'>One purchase. Three files you'll use for years.</h2>
      <ul class='pack-list'>
        <li data-rv><span class='ic'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h13v16H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z'/><path d='M4 19V5M8 7h7'/></svg></span><b>The book</b><span>279 pages, 33 chapters, PDF. Readable on any phone, tablet, or computer.</span></li>
        <li data-rv><span class='ic'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><rect x='4' y='3' width='16' height='18' rx='2'/><path d='M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5'/></svg></span><b>The 120-Prompt Playbook <em>Free bonus</em></b><span>A separate designed PDF of copy-ready prompts, sorted by the job you need done.</span></li>
        <li data-rv><span class='ic'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z'/></svg></span><b>Practice files</b><span>A messy sales export, a supplier price PDF, a delivery-note photo, templates, and a tested script.</span></li>
