<section class='how' aria-labelledby='aih-how'>
  <div class='wrap'>
    <span class='eyebrow'>Our standard</span>
    <h2 class='h2' id='aih-how'>How we write every guide.</h2>
    <ul class='prin'>
      <li data-rv><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><rect x='3' y='5' width='18' height='16' rx='2'/><path d='M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4'/></svg><h3>Dated and sourced</h3><p>Prices, plans, and features are dated and linked to official sources, so you know what to re-check.</p></li>
      <li data-rv><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9z'/><path d='M14 3v6h6M8 14h8M8 18h5'/></svg><h3>Real practice</h3><p>You learn on real-looking files: messy spreadsheets, supplier PDFs, scanned notes.</p></li>
      <li data-rv><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M9 12l2 2 4-4'/><path d='M12 3l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 7.7-7 9-4-1.3-7-4.5-7-9V6z'/></svg><h3>Tested, not hyped</h3><p>Methods come with test sets and checklists. No secret prompts, no magic promises.</p></li>
      <li data-rv><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='9'/><path d='M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18'/></svg><h3>Independent</h3><p>Written to be accurate and practical. Not affiliated with or endorsed by any AI company.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class='notify' aria-labelledby='aih-notify'>
  <span class='glow' aria-hidden='true'></span>
